; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8528  PRQA message 2842
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8529    Reason: Assertion leads to apparent out of bounds indexing.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8530    Risk: Undefined behaviour.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8531    Prevention: Code inspection. Assertion itself detects out of bounds indexing.
