; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8534  PRQA message 0314, 0316
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8535    Reason: API is defined with pointer to void parameter, so pointer has to be casted to or from void.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8536    Risk: Wrong data access or undefiend behavior for platforms where the byte alignment is not arbitrary.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8537    Prevention: Code inspection and test with the target compiler/platform in the component test.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8538  
