; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8541    Reason: Different pointer type is used to access data.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8542    Risk: Wrong memory is accessed or alignment is incorrect.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8543    Prevention: Code inspection and test of different variants in the component test.
