; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8546  PRQA message 0312
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8547    Reason: Cast to none volatile pointer.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8548    Risk: Incorrect multiple context access.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8549    Prevention: Code inspection checks that the value is not multiple accessed.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8550  
