; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8552  PRQA message 0303
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8553    Reason: Hardware access needs cast between a pointer to volatile object and an integral type.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8554    Risk: Access of unknown memory.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Can\Can.c	  8555    Prevention: Runtime tests.
